# A78 (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera): idle dump, open C:\ (double-click HARD DISC C at
# 195,35 -> window at (307,143), reaching past the right and bottom screen edges),
# arm the serial trace, then two mover drags on the title bar (450,152):
#   1. straight DOWN by 80 px  -> pure move of gl_wtop, source off-screen only at
#      the right/bottom and the move goes AWAY from the left/top: w_move BLITS,
#      moved=TRUE, no WM_REDRAW to the window (gemwmlib.c:951-970,994,1025)
#   2. LEFT by 300 px          -> source past the right edge AND moving left:
#      w_move refuses (stop=DESKWH), the window gets its WM_REDRAW (:951-957)
# Ticks are 200 Hz after the first AES pump of the first EL0 program.
1100 mark A_IDLE
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2400 mark B_WINDOW_OPEN
2500 arm
2600 move 450 152
2800 down
2850 drag 450 192
2900 drag 450 232
3000 up
3100 mark C_MOVED_DOWN
3500 mark D_MOVED_DOWN_2S
3600 down
3650 drag 350 232
3700 drag 250 232
3750 drag 150 232
3850 up
3950 mark E_MOVED_LEFT
4350 mark F_MOVED_LEFT_2S
